# PROV-O terms the Martialis ontology and pipeline/rules use. `make imports`
# extracts a STAR module of ontology/imports/prov-o.ttl for exactly these.
# prov:specializationOf is not here on purpose: PROV-O declares it both an
# annotation and an object property, which OWL 2 DL forbids, so
# martialis:specializationOf maps to it (skos:closeMatch) instead.
http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity
http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent
http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom
http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource
http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo
